{"id":68,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"In close combat, its four arms afford it offensive and defensive supremacy. In but a blink, this valiant Pokémon can overwhelm its foes with more than 1,000 blows from its fists."},{"games":["Shield","Crystal"],"text":"With four arms that react more quickly than it can think, it can execute many punches at once."},{"games":["Sword","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It quickly swings its four arms to rock its opponents with ceaseless punches and chops from all angles."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"One arm alone can move mountains. Using all four arms, this Pokémon fires off awesome punches."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"With four arms, it can attack and defend simultaneously. It’s said to have mastered every martial art in the world."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It grasps its opponents with its four arms and twists them up in an intricate hold. People call it “the Machamp special.”"},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It can lift heavy loads with the greatest of ease. It can even heft dump trucks. But its clumsy fingers prevent it from doing any precision work."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It unleashes megaton-level punches that send opponents flying clear over the horizon."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Machamp is known as the Pokémon that has mastered every kind of martial arts. If it grabs hold of the foe with its four arms, the battle is all but over. The hapless foe is thrown far over the horizon."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Machamp has the power to hurl anything aside. However, trying to do any work requiring care and dexterity causes its arms to get tangled. This Pokémon tends to leap into action before it thinks."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It uses its four powerful arms to pin the limbs of its foe, then throws the victim over the horizon."},{"games":["X","FireRed"],"text":"Its four ruggedly developed arms can launch a flurry of 1,000 punches in just two seconds."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Its four muscled arms slam foes with powerful punches and chops at blinding speed."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It can knock a train flying with a punch. However, it is terrible at delicate work using its fingers."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Guts","hidden":false,"description":"It's so gutsy that having a status condition boosts the Pokémon's Attack stat."},{"name":"No Guard","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon employs no-guard tactics to ensure incoming and outgoing attacks always land."},{"name":"Steadfast","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's determination boosts its Speed stat every time it flinches."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":2,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"mountain","color":"Gray","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":66,"name":"Machop","condition":null,"children":[{"id":67,"name":"Machoke","condition":"Lv. 28","children":[{"id":68,"name":"Machamp","condition":"Trade","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,43],[1,67],[1,116],[1,279],[1,469],[12,490],[16,282],[20,184],[24,233],[31,70],[36,530],[42,339],[48,69],[54,223],[60,238],[66,38]],"machine":[372,213,34,280,339,523,370,440,663,91,89,227,203,263,126,7,53,374,411,116,416,484,270,667,63,8,113,67,490,25,5,118,371,398,182,240,156,514,279,179,350,157,317,496,184,214,173,707,444,164,241,276,168,675,9,526],"egg":[],"tutor":[811]},"cards":[{"id":"sv3pt5-68","name":"Machamp","set":"151","date":"2023-09-22","rarity":"Rare","number":"68","artist":"Ryuta Fuse","img":"sv3pt5/68"},{"id":"swsh11-88","name":"Machamp","set":"Lost Origin","date":"2022-09-09","rarity":"Rare Holo","number":"88","artist":"Nisota Niso","img":"swsh11/88"},{"id":"swsh10-72","name":"Machamp V","set":"Astral Radiance","date":"2022-05-27","rarity":"Rare Holo V","number":"72","artist":"kawayoo","img":"swsh10/72"},{"id":"swsh10-73","name":"Machamp VMAX","